Design of the bounded task:

**Task W020-F2B-REV13-MINIMAL-REPAIR-SPEC-01**
- Class: AF-SCC-C0-VAC-GEN, node F2b, gate G-FORM.
- Inputs pinned:
  - schemas/af_scc_c0_vacuum.yaml (sha256 b2ab6acb2bbe...)
